  non-fact tests.
  strict (yield ends only): 47,953 actions (533,668 operators) become 3,937 actions. The task: 71,324 -> 27,308
    actions; 583,670 -> 64,240 operators (70 pick, 31 pick variables); 9,324,673 -> 1,098,741 effects.
