    conditional). 60 folds have a hole (their paths do not cover the union; there the action writes nothing).
  every end, same locals required: 58,908 actions (567,586 operators) become 6,716 (29,029); the task 19,132
    actions, 45,113 operators, 777,950 effects.
  the check (m8_foldcheck.out): 0 mismatches in 116,488 states over the 58,932 folded paths (method above).
